  "open_questions": [
    "Tables are on TDS page 2 (DL2-13065.pdf p.2). Density holds 'LBS PER U.S. GAL @ 15.6 C 8.18' (Target), with 'LBS PER IMP GAL @ 15.6 C 9.82' and the SDS 'Bulk density' as alternate entries; 'SPECIFIC GRAVITY @ 15.6 C 0.962 0.982 1.002' is recorded in the optional specific_gravity property (2026-10-24). Package TBN, Mg, B, Mo, S not printed.",
    "SDS DL2-13713.pdf p.2 component shares (not element contents): Mineral oil 40 – 50%; Zinc alkyl dithiophosphate 5 – 10%; Calcium sulfonate 1 – 5%; Alkylated phenol 0.1 – 0.5%.",
    "SDS p.5 Section 9 values agree with the TDS (no conflicts); SDS also prints viscosities at 25 °C (5753 mm2/s), 20 °C (8574 mm2/s) and 50 mPa.s at 122.4 °C.",
    "[History] User decision 2026-10-17: the density field stored 0.982 (specific gravity, dimensionless) from 'SPECIFIC GRAVITY @ 15.6 C 0.962 0.982 1.002' (DL2-13065.pdf p.2). Superseded 2026-10-24 by the approved optional specific_gravity property: the specific gravity moved there and density now holds the printed 8.18 lbs/US gal @ 15.6 C."
  ],
